### Variables
@host = http://localhost:8080

---
### 1. Create a Student (POST /api/students)
POST {{host}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentNumber": "S-2026-001",
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@university.edu",
  "academicYear": 2
}

### 2. Get a Student by ID (GET /api/students/{id})
GET {{host}}/api/students/1

### 3. Update a Student (PUT /api/students/{id})
PUT {{host}}/api/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentNumber": "S-2026-001",
  "firstName": "Johnathan",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@university.edu",
  "academicYear": 3
}

### 4. Create a Course (POST /api/courses)
POST {{host}}/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseCode": "CS-404",
  "title": "Backend Development",
  "description": "Advanced server-side programming and architecture.",
  "credits": 4
}

### 5. Get a Course by ID (GET /api/courses/{id})
GET {{host}}/api/courses/1

### 6. Update a Course (PUT /api/courses/{id})
PUT {{host}}/api/courses/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseCode": "CS-404",
  "title": "Backend Development & APIs",
  "description": "Advanced server-side programming and architecture.",
  "credits": 4
}

### 7. Enroll a Student in a Course (POST /api/enrollments)
# This is the endpoint that triggers the business rule if executed twice
POST {{host}}/api/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 1,
  "courseId": 1,
  "semester": "Fall 2026"
}

### 8. Get a Student's Schedule (GET /api/students/{id}/schedule)
# Report endpoint (Beyond plain CRUD)
GET {{host}}/api/students/1/schedule

### 9. List All Competencies (GET /api/competencies)
GET {{host}}/api/competencies

### 10. Search Courses by Competency (GET /api/courses/search?competency={name})
# Filter endpoint (Beyond plain CRUD)
GET {{host}}/api/courses/search?competency=Programming

### 11. Drop a Course Enrollment (DELETE /api/enrollments/{id})
DELETE {{host}}/api/enrollments/1

### 12. Delete a Course (DELETE /api/courses/{id})
DELETE {{host}}/api/courses/1

### 13. Delete a Student (DELETE /api/students/{id})
DELETE {{host}}/api/students/1